       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TINVPRPT.
       AUTHOR.        LS BAKER/A TREUDLER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  MAY 2, 1984.

      *D REMARKS.       INVOICE PROCESSING.
      *D                THIS PROGRAM READS THE PO-RLSE FILE CREATED IN
      *D                THE PRELIMINARY REPORT FRONT-END PROGRAM (TINVPREP).
      *D                IT SORTS THE PO-RLSE NUMBERS IN ASCENDING ORDER
      *D                AND PRODUCES A REPORT SHOWING PURCHASE ORDER,
      *D                RECEIVING SLIP AND FREIGHT INFORMATION, AND
      *D                INVOICE DATA FOR THOSE PO-RLSE NUMBERS.
      *D
      *C         APRIL 18,1985;  ADDED INVOICE INFORMATION TO THE
      *C                         REPORT.  -B. WINTER.
      *C
      *C         JUNE 25, 1985;  ADDED TAX CODE, NO CHECK INDICATOR,
      *C                         NINTH CE ENTRY, AND INVOICE STATUS
      *C                         TO REPORT.  -B. WINTER.
      *C
      *C  MAY 10, 1994    CR KALMAN        REQUEST # 6502
      *C  ALLOWED PREPAID FREIGHT INFORMATION TO APPEAR ON THE REPORT.
      *C
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C  ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  JULY 11, 1996   CA YODER
      *C  RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      C01 IS NEWPAGE.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT  SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
           SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPORCV-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MSTORERM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPORECD-I
