       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PRINT-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS  133  CHARACTERS.
       01  PRINT-RCD                 PIC X(133).

       SD  SORT-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS  14  CHARACTERS.
       01  SORT-RCD.
           05  SD-PO-RLSE            PIC X(14).

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       FD  MPORCV-I
